# GludioWizardStand's see-creature hook on Aden's standing wizard (35249), whose DD_MAGIC is
# the shipped Aden Flame (4114): the wizard that sees the character wants to cast it on the
# character from where it stands, weight 1000000, and casts it at its next think.
character Hunter 20
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.siegeguards.GludioWizardStand
npc wizard 35249 SiegeGuard 150 0 0 walks clan aden_siege_clan 300 skill DD_MAGIC 4114 1

approach wizard
  desires wizard cast(player,4114)=1000000

tick x2
  S MagicSkillUse caster=wizard target=player skill=4114-1 hit=10571 reuse=39642 success=0
